        "id": "s1",
        "title": {
          "en": "The tenth statue",
          "hi": "दसवीं प्रतिमा"
        },
        "image": {
          "id": "cs-voice-s1",
          "brief": "The tenth statue with sharp sandstone edges holding a small stone bell, an inscription on her plinth; Śuka peering at it; Dādī pointing at a single letter; Lubdhaka's foreman holding up a lamp behind them; early evening light.",
          "alt": {
            "en": "A statue with sharp edges holding a stone bell while a parrot peers at the inscription on her plinth",
            "hi": "तीखे किनारों वाली प्रतिमा पत्थर की घण्टी थामे, आसन के अभिलेख को झाँकता तोता"
