          "success": {
            "en": "“वाग्दानम्,” you say, “a promise of speech,” and the stone bell in the statue's hand rings, once, clear, a soft round note, not the hard clack it made before. “तदस्ति,” she says. “That is.” Her sharp edges, one by one, grow a little less sharp, as if the voice had run back through the stone.",
